# "swaswa" = exactly, precisely -- the Kabyle "sharp" that closes a whole-hour
# reading ("d lɛecṛa swaswa" = it is ten exactly).  kab.wikipedia uses it in
# its plain adverbial sense:
#   "war ma nezmer ad d-nessiweḍ ad d-nini swaswa asmi i teɣli tneggarut-a"
#     (Tamurt n Leqbayel)
#   "Lqedd n iɣezzuba n tnezzut n temdint-a ur tettwassen ara swaswa" (Bgayet)
swaswa
